cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use POOH in academic work, please cite this software using these metadata."
type: software
title: "POOH: A research software platform for Petri-net-based concurrent control systems and XT/R-exact hypergraph decomposition"
abstract: >-
  POOH (Power Objects of Hypergraphs) is a research software platform for
  modelling, analysing and decomposing Petri-net-based concurrent control
  systems. It supports Petri-net import and drawing, P-invariant and
  state-machine-component computation, selection-hypergraph construction,
  FRA reduction, transversal enumeration, XT/1-exact, c-exact and r-exact
  analysis, decomposition visualization, local max-plus timing models,
  structurally generated Takagi-Sugeno fuzzy artifacts, and reproducible
  CPU/WebGPU benchmark reporting.
